{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mathbits</strong> is a dynamic and challenging math-based game that sharpens your logic, memory, and problem-solving skills through a variety of interactive game modes. Whether you're a casual player or a math enthusiast, Mathbits offers a fun and educational experience with over 50 unique ways to play across seven core categories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guessbit</strong>: Guess a hidden number within a given range using feedback hints like &quot;higher&quot; or &quot;lower.&quot; Speed and intuition are key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Membit</strong>: Test your memory by recalling and typing back numbers, dates, IBANs, phone numbers, and more \u2014 with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solvebit</strong>: Tackle math equations of all kinds \u2014 from basic arithmetic to complex algebra. Can you solve them all under pressure?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphbit</strong>: Analyze graphs and equations to find missing parameters. Combine visual thinking with mathematical logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seriesbit</strong>: Spot patterns and continue number sequences like Fibonacci, primes, and more. It\u2019s all about recognizing trends fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calcubit</strong>: Solve derivatives as quickly as you can, also challenge yourself with double derivates if brave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matrixbit</strong>: Do complex matrix operations as fast as you can.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 10+ unique challenges in each category, Mathbits is designed to train different parts of your brain while keeping you engaged and entertained. Also enable modifiers like LSD, Cats, Time Attack, Practice and more to add an extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your progress with advanced statistics\u00a0</strong>and <strong>climb the leaderboards</strong>\u00a0among your friends.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669500?t=1753698822","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669500?t=1753698822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669500/a3d47d5915235e457613e6ce8e6036235d13bc9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753698822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669500/a3d47d5915235e457613e6ce8e6036235d13bc9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753698822","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mathbits</strong> is a dynamic and challenging math-based game that sharpens your logic, memory, and problem-solving skills through a variety of interactive game modes. Whether you're a casual player or a math enthusiast, Mathbits offers a fun and educational experience with over 50 unique ways to play across seven core categories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guessbit</strong>: Guess a hidden number within a given range using feedback hints like &quot;higher&quot; or &quot;lower.&quot; Speed and intuition are key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Membit</strong>: Test your memory by recalling and typing back numbers, dates, IBANs, phone numbers, and more \u2014 with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solvebit</strong>: Tackle math equations of all kinds \u2014 from basic arithmetic to complex algebra. Can you solve them all under pressure?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphbit</strong>: Analyze graphs and equations to find missing parameters. Combine visual thinking with mathematical logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seriesbit</strong>: Spot patterns and continue number sequences like Fibonacci, primes, and more. It\u2019s all about recognizing trends fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calcubit</strong>: Solve derivatives as quickly as you can, also challenge yourself with double derivates if brave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matrixbit</strong>: Do complex matrix operations as fast as you can.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 10+ unique challenges in each category, Mathbits is designed to train different parts of your brain while keeping you engaged and entertained. Also enable modifiers like LSD, Cats, Time Attack, Practice and more to add an extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your progress with advanced statistics\u00a0</strong>and <strong>climb the leaderboards</strong>\u00a0among your friends.</p>","developers":["DFOUR"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669500/9d9b22d6a1850c874f27f14858e794f0e9883d37/header.jpg?t=1753698822","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></u